  "scope": "Optional presentation-only 3D viewer for the nb1 documentation home. No compiler, WASM, transport, simulation, API or device state.",
  "adaptations": [
    "Viewer accepts a component-owned stage instead of querying the document.",
    "Vue mount/unmount owns listeners, observers, animation, WebGL and pending async load cancellation.",
    "Model notes link to the localized docs architecture attribution.",
    "Native Vue component retains reference CAD-derived two-face fallback paths and unspecified state.",
    "Mobile copy pass: visible drag hint shortened; full canvas keyboard/zoom labels and all viewer behavior retained. Native model-details disclosure keeps fixed LED labels, no-device context and attribution discoverable.",
    "Viewer and Vue links honor the configured project base for static hosting.",
    "Public CAD metadata omits local paths, physical-device identifiers and private project-note excerpts; a project-note-only code comment and excerpt asset are excluded. Original private handoff is preserved. STL geometry, Three.js, licenses and approved brand artwork are unchanged.",
    "The display assembly and source notice now come from the pinned blink(1) Models package. The documentation viewer and its lifecycle stay local."
